sequenceDiagram
    participant H as QA slot harness
    participant B as Slot Bridge
    participant R as Real Runner
    participant W as Sandbox worktree
    participant P as GitHub PR 196

    H->>B: Inject real Linear issue FLY-202
    B->>R: Start Runner with hydrated issue context
    R->>W: Read root directories, QA README, and target
    R->>W: Run bounded document validator
    alt Current evidence already matches
        W-->>R: PASS - keep target bytes unchanged
    else Evidence mismatch
        R->>W: Repair only the mismatched section, keep inherited tail
        R->>W: Re-run validator until PASS
    end
    R->>P: Fast-forward push current branch
    P-->>H: Open PR remains available for QA observation
